{
    "title": "Manticore - Blackwell Hold",
    "kind": "quest",
    "startsWhen": "quest(manticore_yard) == 2",
    "variables": [
        {
            "name": "cells",
            "value": "0"
        }
    ],
    "steps": [
        {
            "type": "wait",
            "seconds": 4
        },
        {
            "type": "title",
            "title": {
                "en": "MANTICORE",
                "zh": "蝎尾狮号"
            },
            "subtitle": {
                "en": "Chapter 16 - Blackwell Hold",
                "zh": "第十六章 - 黑井监狱"
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "dialog",
            "pages": [
                {
                    "speaker": "terran Bryce Vantok",
                    "text": {
                        "en": "Stay close to Nheeta's hauler. Their scanners will read you as part of her cargo. Once inside the guns' reach, you open the cell blocks.",
                        "zh": "紧贴妮塔的运输船。他们的扫描仪会把你当成她的货。一进入炮火范围，你就去打开牢房区。"
                    }
                },
                {
                    "speaker": "terran female Sun Khanna",
                    "text": {
                        "en": "Sun Khanna, flying with you. I taught Hayley to fly. I'm not staying behind for this one.",
                        "zh": "我是孙·坎娜，和你一起飞。海莉的飞行是我教的。这一次我不会留在后面。"
                    }
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "checkpoint",
            "name": "blackwell_briefed"
        },
        {
            "type": "questorbit",
            "station": "manticore_neox:blackwell"
        },
        {
            "type": "goto",
            "station": "manticore_neox:blackwell",
            "dock": false,
            "objective": {
                "en": "Fly to Blackwell Hold's outer marker and meet Nheeta.",
                "zh": "飞往黑井监狱的外围信标，与妮塔会合。"
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "wait",
            "seconds": 8
        },
        {
            "type": "spawn",
            "ship": 15,
            "race": "nivelian",
            "count": 1,
            "behaviour": "friendly",
            "name": "Nheeta Hauler"
        },
        {
            "type": "spawn",
            "ship": 5,
            "race": "terran",
            "count": 1,
            "behaviour": "friendly",
            "name": "Khanna"
        },
        {
            "type": "shipfollow",
            "ship": "Nheeta Hauler",
            "leader": "player",
            "offset": "0 400 1500"
        },
        {
            "type": "shipfollow",
            "ship": "Khanna",
            "leader": "player",
            "offset": "800 0 -600",
            "escort": true
        },
        {
            "type": "radio",
            "speaker": "nivelian female Nheeta",
            "text": {
                "en": "There you are. Stay in my shadow, keep your guns cold, and smile for the cameras. If my hauler dies, so does the plan.",
                "zh": "你来了。待在我的影子里，枪口别热，对着摄像头笑一笑。我的运输船要是没了，计划也就完了。"
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "wait",
            "seconds": 6
        },
        {
            "type": "wreck",
            "race": "terran",
            "name": "Cell Block A",
            "at": "-6000 0 28000"
        },
        {
            "type": "wreck",
            "race": "terran",
            "name": "Cell Block B",
            "at": "6000 2000 30000"
        },
        {
            "type": "on",
            "trigger": "hacked",
            "steps": [
                {
                    "type": "set",
                    "variable": "cells",
                    "value": "cells + 1"
                },
                {
                    "type": "radio",
                    "speaker": "terran female Jalen",
                    "text": {
                        "en": "Cell block open. {cells} of 2.",
                        "zh": "牢房区已打开。{cells} / 2。"
                    }
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "objective",
            "station": "manticore_neox:blackwell",
            "text": {
                "en": "Hack both cell blocks.",
                "zh": "破解两个牢房区。"
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "waituntil",
            "condition": "cells >= 1"
        },
        {
            "type": "radio",
            "speaker": "pirate Warden Mortak",
            "text": {
                "en": "Intruders in the cell blocks! All guards, kill everything that isn't ours!",
                "zh": "牢房区有入侵者！所有守卫，凡不是自己人的统统杀掉！"
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "fight",
            "station": "manticore_neox:blackwell",
            "quiet": false,
            "name": "Hold Guard",
            "ships": [
                {
                    "ship": 54,
                    "count": 2,
                    "race": "pirate",
                    "behaviour": "enemy"
                },
                {
                    "ship": 23,
                    "count": 2,
                    "race": "pirate",
                    "behaviour": "enemy"
                }
            ],
            "objective": {
                "en": "Fight off the Hold's guards.",
                "zh": "击退监狱的守卫。"
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "if",
            "condition": "alive(Nheeta Hauler) == 0",
            "then": [
                {
                    "type": "fail",
                    "title": {
                        "en": "Nheeta's hauler was lost.",
                        "zh": "妮塔的运输船被毁了。"
                    }
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "objective",
            "station": "manticore_neox:blackwell",
            "text": {
                "en": "Hack the second cell block.",
                "zh": "破解第二个牢房区。"
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "waituntil",
            "condition": "cells >= 2"
        },
        {
            "type": "radio",
            "speaker": "terran female Hayley Snocom",
            "text": {
                "en": "This is Hayley Snocom. Whoever opened that door, I owe you a drink. Get the others out first.",
                "zh": "我是海莉·斯诺科姆。不管是谁开的门，我欠你一杯。先把其他人救出去。"
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "radio",
            "speaker": "terran female Saya",
            "text": {
                "en": "Hayley! It's Saya! Hold on, we're coming for you!",
                "zh": "海莉！我是萨娅！坚持住，我们来接你了！"
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "radio",
            "speaker": "pirate Warden Mortak",
            "text": {
                "en": "The Snocom girl stays! Seal the hold and burn the prisoners if you must!",
                "zh": "斯诺科姆那丫头不准走！封锁监狱，必要时把犯人烧了！"
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "fight",
            "station": "manticore_neox:blackwell",
            "quiet": false,
            "name": "Warden Mortak",
            "ships": [
                {
                    "ship": 63,
                    "count": 1,
                    "race": "pirate",
                    "behaviour": "enemy"
                },
                {
                    "ship": 9,
                    "count": 2,
                    "race": "pirate",
                    "behaviour": "enemy"
                }
            ],
            "objective": {
                "en": "Defeat Warden Mortak.",
                "zh": "击败典狱长莫塔克。"
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "if",
            "condition": "alive(Nheeta Hauler) == 0",
            "then": [
                {
                    "type": "fail",
                    "title": {
                        "en": "Nheeta's hauler was lost with the prisoners.",
                        "zh": "妮塔的运输船连同犯人一起被毁了。"
                    }
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "questorbit",
            "station": "manticore_neox:blackwell",
            "on": false
        },
        {
            "type": "radio",
            "speaker": "nivelian female Nheeta",
            "text": {
                "en": "Prisoners aboard. Hayley too. She's thin, but she's grinning. Now get us out of here.",
                "zh": "犯人都上船了，海莉也在。她瘦了，但在笑。现在快带我们离开。"
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "reward",
            "credits": 36000,
            "title": {
                "en": "Prisoners freed",
                "zh": "犯人获救"
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "checkpoint",
            "name": "mortak_down"
        },
        {
            "type": "goto",
            "station": "manticore_neox:manticore",
            "dock": true,
            "objective": {
                "en": "Return to the Manticore.",
                "zh": "返回蝎尾狮号。"
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "dialog",
            "pages": [
                {
                    "speaker": "terran female Hayley Snocom",
                    "text": {
                        "en": "Saya. You kept my Styx's frequency on your board all these years? Sentimental idiot.",
                        "zh": "萨娅。你这些年一直把我的冥河号频率留在面板上？多愁善感的傻瓜。"
                    }
                },
                {
                    "speaker": "terran female Saya",
                    "text": {
                        "en": "Shut up and let me hug you.",
                        "zh": "闭嘴，让我抱抱你。"
                    }
                },
                {
                    "speaker": "terran female Hayley Snocom",
                    "text": {
                        "en": "Commander. Indigo Brink was never the top. Every Grey Shadow credit, every Lancer contract, it all went somewhere else. I heard the guards. They call it 'the Board'.",
                        "zh": "指挥官。靛蓝深渊从来都不是最顶层的。灰影的每一笔钱、枪骑兵的每一份合同，最后都流向了别处。我听到守卫们说过，他们叫它“董事会”。"
                    }
                },
                {
                    "speaker": "terran Bryce Vantok",
                    "text": {
                        "en": "Then it isn't over. But tonight, Hayley Snocom is home.",
                        "zh": "那就还没结束。但今晚，海莉·斯诺科姆回家了。"
                    }
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "complete",
            "reward": 14000,
            "title": {
                "en": "Chapter 16 complete",
                "zh": "第十六章 完成"
            }
        }
    ]
}
